# PlanetFormationSim — generated artifacts only. Source code (core physics modules,
# validation.py, run_scripts/) is tracked; everything a run PRODUCES is not.

# ==========================================
# All generated simulation output (snapshots, diagnostic/evolution plots, per-run logs) -
# output.py/diagnostics.py always write under this one master root (diagnostics.OUTPUT_ROOT).
# ==========================================
outputs/

# ==========================================
# Python bytecode cache - never source, regenerated automatically on every run.
# ==========================================
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# ==========================================
# Editor/OS cruft
# ==========================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ==========================================
# Ad hoc local scratch files (dev_cache.py pickles, one-off diagnostic checkpoints) -
# never meant to be shared/reviewed, regenerable on demand.
# ==========================================
*.pkl
*_checkpoint.npz
*_checkpoint.txt
